#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:62
msgid ""
"Usage: %s [command] [options]\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  check        Check the Wi-Fi and recover it if needed (default; used by "
"the timer)\n"
"  status       Show Wi-Fi and watchdog status plus the latest events\n"
"  disconnect   Disconnect the Wi-Fi manually; the watchdog will not "
"reconnect until \"on\"\n"
"  off          Turn the Wi-Fi radio off; stays off (even after reboot) until "
"\"on\"\n"
"  on           Turn the Wi-Fi on, re-enable autoconnect and connect to the "
"networks\n"
"  test         Simulate a driver hang and verify the watchdog recovers it "
"(root)\n"
"  gui [ACTION] Desktop dialog used by the menu entry; ACTION is status, off, "
"on or recover\n"
"\n"
"Options for \"check\":\n"
"  --dry-run    Only report what would be done, change nothing\n"
"  --force      Skip straight to reloading the kernel module\n"
"\n"
"Configuration: %s"
msgstr ""
"Ús: %s [ordre] [opcions]\n"
"\n"
"Ordres:\n"
"  check        Comprova la Wi-Fi i la recupera si cal (per defecte; l'usa el "
"temporitzador)\n"
"  status       Mostra l'estat de la Wi-Fi i del vigilant, i els últims "
"esdeveniments\n"
"  disconnect   Desconnecta la Wi-Fi manualment; el vigilant no la tornarà a "
"connectar fins a \"on\"\n"
"  off          Apaga la ràdio Wi-Fi; continua apagada (fins i tot després de "
"reiniciar) fins a \"on\"\n"
"  on           Encén la Wi-Fi, reactiva la connexió automàtica i es connecta "
"a les xarxes\n"
"  test         Simula un penjament del controlador i comprova que el "
"vigilant el recupera (root)\n"
"  gui [ACCIÓ]  Diàleg d'escriptori que usa l'entrada del menú; ACCIÓ és "
"status, off, on o recover\n"
"\n"
"Opcions de \"check\":\n"
"  --dry-run    Només informa del que faria, sense canviar res\n"
"  --force      Passa directament a recarregar el mòdul del nucli\n"
"\n"
"Configuració: %s"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:104 ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:237
msgid "[dry-run] %s"
msgstr "[simulació] %s"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:112
msgid "The \"%s\" command requires root: sudo %s %s"
msgstr "L'ordre \"%s\" necessita permisos de root: sudo %s %s"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:139
msgid "Wi-Fi radio is off"
msgstr "La ràdio Wi-Fi està apagada"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:145
msgid "%s was disconnected manually"
msgstr "%s s'ha desconnectat manualment"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:180
