#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:493 ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:501
msgid "Show status and latest events"
msgstr "Mostra l'estat i els últims esdeveniments"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:494 ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:502
msgid "Turn Wi-Fi off"
msgstr "Apaga la Wi-Fi"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:495 ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:503
msgid "Turn Wi-Fi on"
msgstr "Encén la Wi-Fi"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:496 ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:504
msgid "Recover now (asks for the password)"
msgstr "Recupera ara (demana la contrasenya)"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:499
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Acció"

#: ../eduwifi-watchdog.sh:506
msgid "No graphical session or dialog tool (kdialog or zenity) available."
msgstr ""
"No hi ha sessió gràfica ni cap eina de diàlegs (kdialog o zenity) disponible."

#: ../install.sh:34
msgid ""
"Usage: sudo %s [options]\n"
"\n"
"Installs eduwifi-watchdog, enables its systemd timer and adds a menu entry.\n"
"Requires root. Without options it asks for the settings interactively.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --networks \"Net1,Net2\"   NetworkManager profiles to retry, comma-"
"separated,\n"
"                           in priority order (skips the networks question)\n"
"  --uninstall              Remove the script, the systemd units, the menu "
"entry\n"
"                           and the translations (keeps %s)\n"
"  -h, --help               Show this help"
msgstr ""
"Ús: sudo %s [opcions]\n"
"\n"
"Instal·la eduwifi-watchdog, activa el seu temporitzador de systemd i afig "
"una entrada al menú.\n"
"Necessita permisos de root. Sense opcions, demana la configuració de manera "
"interactiva.\n"
"\n"
"Opcions:\n"
"  --networks \"Net1,Net2\"   Perfils de NetworkManager que cal reintentar, "
"separats per comes,\n"
"                           en ordre de prioritat (omet la pregunta de les "
"xarxes)\n"
"  --uninstall              Elimina l'script, les unitats de systemd, "
"l'entrada del menú\n"
"                           i les traduccions (conserva %s)\n"
"  -h, --help               Mostra esta ajuda"

#: ../install.sh:62
msgid "This installer requires root. Run it with: sudo %s"
msgstr "Este instal·lador necessita permisos de root. Executa'l amb: sudo %s"

#: ../install.sh:73
msgid ""
"Uninstalled. The configuration %s was kept (delete it manually if you want)."
msgstr ""
"Desinstal·lat. S'ha conservat la configuració %s (esborra-la manualment si "
"vols)."

