msgstr "Xarxes Wi-Fi guardades en NetworkManager:"

#: ../install.sh:114
msgid "Networks to retry, comma-separated, in priority order"
msgstr "Xarxes que cal reintentar, separades per comes, en ordre de prioritat"

#: ../install.sh:123
msgid "Warning: \"%s\" is not a NetworkManager profile"
msgstr "Avís: \"%s\" no és un perfil de NetworkManager"

#: ../install.sh:156
msgid ""
"Warning: msgfmt not found (package gettext); installed without translations."
msgstr ""
"Avís: no s'ha trobat msgfmt (paquet gettext); s'ha instal·lat sense "
"traduccions."

#: ../install.sh:164
msgid "Configuration saved to %s:"
msgstr "Configuració guardada en %s:"

#: ../install.sh:169
msgid ""
"Menu entry: \"Wi-Fi watchdog\" (right-click it for quick actions).\n"
"\n"
"Useful commands:\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             status and latest events\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         disconnect manually (the watchdog will "
"not reconnect)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                turn the Wi-Fi off until you turn it "
"back on\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 turn on and reconnect\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                open the desktop dialog\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simulate a hang and verify it "
"recovers\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   follow the log"
msgstr ""
"Entrada del menú: «Vigilant de la Wi-Fi» (fes-hi clic amb el botó dret per a "
"accions ràpides).\n"
"\n"
"Ordres útils:\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             estat i últims esdeveniments\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         desconnecta manualment (el vigilant no "
"la tornarà a connectar)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                apaga la Wi-Fi fins que la tornes a "
"encendre\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 l'encén i es torna a connectar\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                obri el diàleg d'escriptori\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simula un penjament i comprova que es "
"recupera\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   segueix el registre"

